{"id":"wb-1-63","name":"大雁塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大雁塔","text":"大雁塔是位于中华人民共和国陕西省西安市雁塔区大慈恩寺内的唐代佛塔。唐永徽三年（652年），玄奘为保存从印度带回的佛经和佛像主持建塔，初建塔为五层；此后经武周重建和历代修缮，形成现存七层方形砖塔。\n大雁塔与玄奘主持的佛经翻译事业相联系，是唐代长安佛教传播和中外文化交流的实物遗存。唐代新科进士曾在慈恩寺塔下题名，“雁塔题名”因而成为科举及第的典故。大雁塔于1961年列入第一批全国重点文物保护单位，2014年作为“丝绸之路：长安—天山廊道的路网”组成部分列入《世界遗产名录》。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E9%9B%81%E5%A1%94","revisionId":95083212,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95083212","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/58987b1f4bc93ba830c5844f.jpg","title":"Giant_Wild_Goose_Pagoda.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Giant_Wild_Goose_Pagoda.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/13/Giant_Wild_Goose_Pagoda.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Alex Kwok","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"​西安大雁塔","width":320,"height":240}}